OL,4,BBottas' stay at Cadillac confirmed for 
OL,5,B2027                                   
OL,6,GValtteri Bottas has been retained by   
OL,7,GCadillac for the 2027 Formula 1 season.
OL,9,FThe future of the 37-year-old Finn had 
OL,10,Fbeen in doubt as the American team     
OL,11,Fendure a difficult maiden campaign.    
OL,13,FTo date, they have failed to collect a 
OL,14,Fpoint in either the drivers' or        
OL,15,Fconstructors' championship.            
OL,17,FHowever, two-time championship runner- 
OL,18,Fup Bottas will race again with them    
OL,19,Fnext year.                             
